[{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02280000_03_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02280000_03_0010","text":"（阳希，今天也在自主练习吗……）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02280000_03_0020","text":"──────…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02280000_03_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02280000_03_0030","text":"──阳希"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02280000_03_0040","text":"路加的麦克风，\n谢谢你帮她擦得这么干净"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02280000_03_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02280000_03_0050","text":"嗯……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02280000_03_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02280000_03_0060","text":"但是————"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02280000_03_0070","text":"不管怎么擦，\n伤痕都没办法擦掉────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02280000_03_0080","text":"啊啊……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02280000_03_0090","text":"不过，那些伤痕也很帅气"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02280000_03_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02280000_03_0100","text":"那一定是路加酱\n一路战斗过来的证明吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02280000_03_0110","text":"我……有没有像那样\n全力以赴过呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02280000_03_0120","text":"我一边想着这些，一边擦着麦克风"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02280000_03_0130","text":"是吗────……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02280000_03_0131","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02280000_03_0140","text":"（阳希……表情和平时不一样──……）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02280000_03_0150","text":"……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02280000_03_0151","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02280000_03_0160","text":"（咦，这首歌不是\n　已经掌握了吗……）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02280000_03_0161","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02280000_03_0170","text":"（这个舞步……在哪里────）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02280000_03_0171","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02280000_03_0180","text":"……！\n────哈……！"}]
